   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "How could you tell, Futaba?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_043_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Talk about a nasty trick...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_044_0_0#0",
